<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 10.2 pct in year to April.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 10.2 pct in year to April.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for April -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY				     APRIL  PVS REPORTED</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)		+0.2	+0.3</p>
<p>	 in year to date (adjusted)		+10.2    +10.4</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)	    -0.8	-0.7</p>
<p>	 in year to date (unadjusted)	    +10.0    +10.2</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks, building</p>
<p>    societies in billions of stg		  4.4	 4.4</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
